To solve this problem, we can use a greedy algorithm. The idea is to find the most typical student in each group of known pairs. The most typical student is the one who was paired with the most students in the group. This will minimize the maximum number of souvenirs the unluckiest student has to give.

Here's the Python program that implements this solution:

```python
